      "findings": [
        "All 4 revision items from round 1 are fixed and re-verified: (1) content now sits below a light status bar on every screen, (2) the reviewer '☰' opens the navigation drawer, (3) the settings '搜索...' placeholder is left-aligned next to the search icon, (4) the deck-list footer stays on one line.",
        "Deck counts aggregate correctly over subdecks and match the supplied deck_tree.json seed (18 cards: new 14 / learn 1 / due 3); after study and a new note the tree stays consistent.",
        "Session completion returns to the deck list with the snackbar '恭喜！你已经完成了今天的学习任务。' and an action button, matching the observed behaviour.",
        "Studying with 简单 graduates a new card directly; 良好 moves it into learning (counters 3 0 0 -> 2 1 0), matching the observed scheduler behaviour.",
        "State (cards, scheduling, tags, stats, added notes) survives a cold restart via SharedPreferences JSON.",
        "Known simplifications, all confined to screens that never rendered during black-box exploration (they hung on a loading spinner): deck options, custom study and the statistics chart are approximated; no private or personal data is present in the build."
      ],
